    method c_type(self, t: LType?) -> string
      source: c_backend.ly:377
      why: "Central authority for mapping Lyric types to C type strings. Primitives map to stdint.h types (TyI32 → int32_t). Class handles become pointers (AoS) or uint32_t (SoA). Optionals on class handles are raw pointers/handles (NULL/0 = none); non-class optionals use LyricOpt<T> tagged structs. Tuples become named structs (LyricTuple_N). TyGenerator reaching this method is an invariant violation — generators are handled by dedicated emitters."
